meta {
  name: class-service
}

docs {
  # class-service API Collection

  Module **M6** of the learning platform: A pragmatic **1EdTech OneRoster v1.2** roster & school directory service.
  
  ## Key Capabilities
  - **School & Course Structure**: Manages Organizations (schools, departments), Courses, and Class Sections.
  - **Identity & Data Minimization**: The **only module in the platform permitted to store personal identities** (name, optional email, role).
  - **Mints `candidateId`**: Every user's `sourcedId` (UUIDv4) is the pseudonymous identifier consumed across all behavioral modules (`quiz-service`, `analytics-service`, `learner-model-service`, `cognee-memory-gateway`).
  - **Rosters & Enrollments**: Associates teachers and students with classes, providing classroom rosters and course membership.
}
